 &lt;BR&gt; 
3. The Statutory Auditors have carried out limited review of the above consolidated financial results for the quarter ended June 30, 2025 as required under Regulation 33 of the SEBI (Listing Obligations &amp; Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015. &lt;BR&gt; 
 &lt;BR&gt; 
